  <body>
    <div>
      <p begin="00:00.240" end="00:03.750" ttm:agent="v1">$NOT+GOSHA+GOSHA+Ayy, b***h, I know you care about</p>
      <p begin="00:03.750" end="00:05.700" ttm:agent="v1">Gosha, and</p>
      <p begin="00:05.700" end="00:07.450" ttm:agent="v1">Pretty things, but</p>
      <p begin="00:07.450" end="00:12.200" ttm:agent="v1">$NOT+GOSHA+GOSHA+But can you tell me what you don’t give a shit about, b***h?</p>
      <p begin="00:12.200" end="00:14.210" ttm:agent="v1">Like</p>
      <p begin="00:14.210" end="00:18.070" ttm:agent="v1">$NOT+GOSHA+GOSHA+What don’t you give a shit about, b***h?</p>
      <p begin="00:18.070" end="00:21.470" ttm:agent="v1">$NOT+GOSHA+GOSHA+I don't give a shit about... hmm</p>
      <p begin="00:21.470" end="00:23.530" ttm:agent="v1">Them niggaz ride d**ks Frank White push the stick</p>
      <p begin="00:23.530" end="00:27.070" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Nice chain, red Balmains (Ayy)</p>
      <p begin="00:27.070" end="00:29.820" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Chain swang, like Pretty Things (Yuh)</p>
      <p begin="00:29.820" end="00:33.160" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">$NOT+GOSHA+GOSHA+Kick a b***h, call me Liu Kang (Liu Kang)</p>
      <p begin="00:33.160" end="00:36.150" ttm:agent="v1">$NOT+GOSHA+GOSHA+Dumb b***h, give me dumb brain, yuh</p>
      <p begin="00:36.150" end="00:38.810" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Wrist wet, wet like rain (Ayy)</p>
      <p begin="00:38.810" end="00:42.230" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">$NOT+GOSHA+GOSHA+Nike Swoosh, White b*****s (C*****a)</p>
      <p begin="00:42.230" end="00:44.850" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Iceberg, that’s Gucci Mane (Burr)</p>
      <p begin="00:44.850" end="00:47.970" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Tall racks like Yao Ming (Yao Ming)</p>
      <p begin="00:47.970" end="00:51.350" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">$NOT+GOSHA+GOSHA+**** school, I don't **** with rules (I don't **** with 'em)</p>
      <p begin="00:51.350" end="00:54.180" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">$NOT+GOSHA+GOSHA+Laid back, b***h, always keep a tool (Keep a tool)</p>
      <p begin="00:54.180" end="00:57.100" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">$NOT+GOSHA+GOSHA+You a b***h ass nigga, you a ****ing fool (You a fool)</p>
      <p begin="00:57.100" end="01:00.190" ttm:agent="v1">Wait, hold up, ayy, ayy</p>
      <p begin="01:00.190" end="01:02.930" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">$NOT+GOSHA+GOSHA+B*****s look at me like I am a jewel (Like a jewel)</p>
      <p begin="01:02.930" end="01:06.210" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">$NOT+GOSHA+GOSHA+I be posted wit’ yo’ b***h in the pool (In the pool)</p>
      <p begin="01:06.210" end="01:09.190" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Blast off—wait, ah, jet fuel (Jet fuel)</p>
      <p begin="01:09.190" end="01:12.200" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">$NOT+GOSHA+GOSHA+**** this world, man, these people so cruel (So cruel)</p>
      <p begin="01:12.200" end="01:14.990" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">What you want from me, Mercedes AMG? (AMG)</p>
      <p begin="01:14.990" end="01:18.180" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">$NOT+GOSHA+GOSHA+Push to start, b***h, no keys (No keys)</p>
      <p begin="01:18.180" end="01:21.230" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">They don’t gotta know about you and me (Nah)</p>
      <p begin="01:21.230" end="01:24.230" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">You the only one I know and I trust (And I trust)</p>
      <p begin="01:24.230" end="01:26.760" ttm:agent="v1">Baby, you my angel and the stardust</p>
      <p begin="01:26.760" end="01:30.230" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">$NOT+GOSHA+GOSHA+Niggas always wanna act so tough (So tough)</p>
      <p begin="01:30.230" end="01:33.210" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Played out, phew, phew, see the cuffs (See the cuffs)</p>
      <p begin="01:33.210" end="01:36.150" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">I be with my soldiers, eatin’ chicken wings (Chicken wings)</p>
      <p begin="01:36.150" end="01:39.150" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">$NOT+GOSHA+GOSHA+B***h, you can’t hang, this is not your game (Not your game)</p>
      <p begin="01:39.150" end="01:42.260" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Black fit, Gosha, Gosha, gold fangs (Gold fangs)</p>
      <p begin="01:42.260" end="01:45.180" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Long clip, Gosha, Gosha, bang, bang (Bang, bang)</p>
      <p begin="01:45.180" end="01:48.230" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Black fit, Gosha, Gosha, gold fangs (Gold fangs)</p>
      <p begin="01:48.230" end="01:51.230" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Long clip, Gosha, Gosha, bang, bang (Bang, bang)</p>
      <p begin="01:51.230" end="01:54.370" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Black fit, Gosha, Gosha, gold fangs (Gold fangs)</p>
      <p begin="01:54.370" end="01:58.370" ttm:agent="v1">Ayy</p>
    </div>
